(Japanese: '''フルコート''' ''Full Court'') is an {{pkmn|animated series}}-exclusive location in [[Unova]]. It is one of the settings of ''[[M15|Kyurem VS. The Sword of Justice]]''.

Full Court is an abandoned mine, complete with train tracks and industrial buildings, located within a mountain crater. It is generally kept shaded from the sun, thanks to its large and jagged rock walls. The dark and cold environment make it a perfect home for {{OBP|Kyurem|M15}} and some {{p|Cryogonal}}. The area is surrounded by pine forests and lies some distance from [[Roshan City]].

{{OBP|Keldeo|M15}} first arrived at Full Court, hoping to defeat Kyurem in a {{pkmn|battle}} and become inducted as a [[Swords of Justice|Sword of Justice]]. Kyurem's sheer size and power proved overwhelming, and Keldeo was forced to flee while the {{OBP|Swords of Justice|M15}} were {{status|Freeze|frozen}} in place. Keldeo eventually returned with {{Ash}} and {{AP|Pikachu}} to redeem itself and save its friends. Though Keldeo and Ash succeeded in saving the Swords of Justice, the second battle caused the entire area to collapse. Fortunately, Kyurem froze it and turned Full Court into an ice castle for it to live in.

