==Trivia==

===Origin===
{{main|Pokémon world in relation to the real world#In the movies|Pokémon world in relation to the real world → In the movies}}
Full Court takes its inspiration from {{wp|Monterrey}}, a city in northern Mexico that serves as an industrial hub for the country and Latin America. Director [[Kunihiko Yuyama]] and his team {{wp|Location scouting|scouted}} the city before the film's production, noting that they were inspired by the large steel mills that he thought would combine interestingly with Kyurem's iciness<ref>[https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WBl5ZJ5T_BU&index=72&list=PLi-MwfPpkXIKdBezAzJ3fM9KeYVzF500y Interview with Director Yuyama] on the official Korean Pokémon YouTube channel (Japanese with Korean subtitles)</ref>.

